    <h1 data-en="Upgrading Your Plan and Managing Your Subscription" data-fr="Mettre à niveau votre forfait et gérer votre abonnement">Upgrading Your Plan and Managing Your Subscription</h1>
    <p data-en="Everything you need to know about plans, payments, and managing your Bookwize subscription." data-fr="Tout ce que vous devez savoir sur les forfaits, les paiements et la gestion de votre abonnement Bookwize.">Everything you need to know about plans, payments, and managing your Bookwize subscription.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="blog-content">
    <p data-en='Your <a href="/blog/how-to-sign-up">free 14-day trial</a> is a great way to experience Bookwize, but it does come with limits. When you are ready to grow — more staff, more services, unlimited bookings — upgrading is quick and straightforward.' data-fr='Votre <a href="/blog/how-to-sign-up">essai gratuit de 14 jours</a> est une excellente façon de découvrir Bookwize, mais il comporte des limites. Lorsque vous êtes prêt à grandir — plus de personnel, plus de services, des réservations illimitées — la mise à niveau est rapide et simple.'>Your <a href="/blog/how-to-sign-up">free 14-day trial</a> is a great way to experience Bookwize, but it does come with limits. When you are ready to grow — more staff, more services, unlimited bookings — upgrading is quick and straightforward.</p>

    <h2 data-en="Understanding Trial Limits" data-fr="Comprendre les limites de l&apos;essai">Understanding Trial Limits</h2>
    <p data-en="During your free trial, your account includes:" data-fr="Pendant votre essai gratuit, votre compte comprend :">During your free trial, your account includes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li data-en='<strong>1 staff member</strong>' data-fr='<strong>1 membre du personnel</strong>'><strong>1 staff member</strong></li>
      <li data-en='<strong>3 services</strong>' data-fr='<strong>3 services</strong>'><strong>3 services</strong></li>
      <li data-en='<strong>10 bookings per month</strong>' data-fr='<strong>10 réservations par mois</strong>'><strong>10 bookings per month</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p data-en="These limits are designed to let you test the platform with real clients. Once you see how Bookwize works for your business, upgrading removes all of these limits and unlocks the full feature set." data-fr="Ces limites sont conçues pour vous permettre de tester la plateforme avec de vrais clients. Une fois que vous voyez comment Bookwize fonctionne pour votre entreprise, la mise à niveau supprime toutes ces limites et débloque l&apos;ensemble des fonctionnalités.">These limits are designed to let you test the platform with real clients. Once you see how Bookwize works for your business, upgrading removes all of these limits and unlocks the full feature set.</p>

    <h2 data-en="How to Upgrade Your Plan" data-fr="Comment mettre à niveau votre forfait">How to Upgrade Your Plan</h2>
    <p data-en="There are two ways to start the upgrade process:" data-fr="Il y a deux façons de commencer le processus de mise à niveau :">There are two ways to start the upgrade process:</p>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3 data-en="Option 1: From the Upgrade Banner" data-fr="Option 1 : Depuis la bannière de mise à niveau">Option 1: From the Upgrade Banner</h3>
      <p data-en='If you are on the free trial, you will see an <strong>"Upgrade Now"</strong> banner at the top of your dashboard showing how many trial days you have left. Click it to go directly to the plan selection page.' data-fr='Si vous êtes en période d&apos;essai gratuit, vous verrez une bannière <strong>« Mettre à niveau maintenant »</strong> en haut de votre tableau de bord indiquant combien de jours d&apos;essai il vous reste. Cliquez dessus pour accéder directement à la page de sélection des forfaits.'>If you are on the free trial, you will see an <strong>"Upgrade Now"</strong> banner at the top of your dashboard showing how many trial days you have left. Click it to go directly to the plan selection page.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3 data-en="Option 2: From Settings" data-fr="Option 2 : Depuis les paramètres">Option 2: From Settings</h3>
      <p data-en='Go to <strong>Settings</strong> in the sidebar, then click the <strong>Billing</strong> tab. Click <strong>View Plans</strong> to see the available options and choose the one that fits your business.' data-fr='Allez dans <strong>Paramètres</strong> dans la barre latérale, puis cliquez sur l&apos;onglet <strong>Facturation</strong>. Cliquez sur <strong>Voir les forfaits</strong> pour voir les options disponibles et choisir celle qui convient à votre entreprise.'>Go to <strong>Settings</strong> in the sidebar, then click the <strong>Billing</strong> tab. Click <strong>View Plans</strong> to see the available options and choose the one that fits your business.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 data-en="Choosing a Plan" data-fr="Choisir un forfait">Choosing a Plan</h2>
    <p data-en='Bookwize offers plans designed for different business sizes. You can choose between <strong>monthly billing</strong> or a <strong>one-time payment</strong> option depending on the plan. Each plan page clearly shows what is included — number of staff, services, and features — so you can compare and pick the right fit.' data-fr='Bookwize offre des forfaits conçus pour différentes tailles d&apos;entreprise. Vous pouvez choisir entre une <strong>facturation mensuelle</strong> ou une option de <strong>paiement unique</strong> selon le forfait. Chaque page de forfait montre clairement ce qui est inclus — nombre de membres du personnel, services et fonctionnalités — pour que vous puissiez comparer et choisir le bon.'>Bookwize offers plans designed for different business sizes. You can choose between <strong>monthly billing</strong> or a <strong>one-time payment</strong> option depending on the plan. Each plan page clearly shows what is included — number of staff, services, and features — so you can compare and pick the right fit.</p>
    <p data-en='For full pricing details, visit the <a href="/#pricing">pricing section</a> on our homepage.' data-fr='Pour tous les détails de tarification, visitez la <a href="/#pricing">section tarifs</a> sur notre page d&apos;accueil.'>For full pricing details, visit the <a href="/#pricing">pricing section</a> on our homepage.</p>

    <blockquote data-en="You only pay when you are ready. There is no automatic charge at the end of your trial — you choose when and if to upgrade." data-fr="Vous ne payez que lorsque vous êtes prêt. Il n&apos;y a aucun frais automatique à la fin de votre essai — c&apos;est vous qui choisissez quand et si vous souhaitez mettre à niveau.">You only pay when you are ready. There is no automatic charge at the end of your trial — you choose when and if to upgrade.</blockquote>

    <h2 data-en="The Payment Process" data-fr="Le processus de paiement">The Payment Process</h2>
    <p data-en="When you select a plan, you are taken to a secure checkout page powered by Stripe. Enter your payment details, confirm the amount, and your upgrade is applied instantly. You will receive an email confirmation with your receipt." data-fr="Lorsque vous sélectionnez un forfait, vous êtes dirigé vers une page de paiement sécurisée propulsée par Stripe. Entrez vos informations de paiement, confirmez le montant et votre mise à niveau est appliquée instantanément. Vous recevrez un courriel de confirmation avec votre reçu.">When you select a plan, you are taken to a secure checkout page powered by Stripe. Enter your payment details, confirm the amount, and your upgrade is applied instantly. You will receive an email confirmation with your receipt.</p>
    <p data-en="Bookwize accepts all major credit and debit cards. Your payment information is handled securely — it is never stored on Bookwize servers." data-fr="Bookwize accepte toutes les cartes de crédit et de débit majeures. Vos informations de paiement sont traitées de manière sécurisée — elles ne sont jamais stockées sur les serveurs de Bookwize.">Bookwize accepts all major credit and debit cards. Your payment information is handled securely — it is never stored on Bookwize servers.</p>

    <h2 data-en="What Happens After You Upgrade" data-fr="Ce qui se passe après la mise à niveau">What Happens After You Upgrade</h2>
    <p data-en="The moment your payment is processed, your account is upgraded:" data-fr="Dès que votre paiement est traité, votre compte est mis à niveau :">The moment your payment is processed, your account is upgraded:</p>
    <ul>
      <li data-en='<strong>Booking limits are removed</strong> — accept as many appointments as you need' data-fr='<strong>Les limites de réservation sont supprimées</strong> — acceptez autant de rendez-vous que vous le souhaitez'><strong>Booking limits are removed</strong> — accept as many appointments as you need</li>
      <li data-en='<strong>Staff limits are removed</strong> — add as many team members as your plan allows' data-fr='<strong>Les limites de personnel sont supprimées</strong> — ajoutez autant de membres d&apos;équipe que votre forfait le permet'><strong>Staff limits are removed</strong> — add as many team members as your plan allows</li>
      <li data-en='<strong>Service limits are removed</strong> — create your full service menu' data-fr='<strong>Les limites de services sont supprimées</strong> — créez votre menu de services complet'><strong>Service limits are removed</strong> — create your full service menu</li>
      <li data-en='<strong>Full features unlocked</strong> — access everything included in your chosen plan' data-fr='<strong>Toutes les fonctionnalités débloquées</strong> — accédez à tout ce qui est inclus dans votre forfait choisi'><strong>Full features unlocked</strong> — access everything included in your chosen plan</li>
    </ul>
    <p data-en="There is no downtime and no need to reconfigure anything. Your existing bookings, customers, and settings stay exactly as they are." data-fr="Il n&apos;y a aucun temps d&apos;arrêt et aucune reconfiguration nécessaire. Vos réservations, clients et paramètres existants restent exactement tels qu&apos;ils sont.">There is no downtime and no need to reconfigure anything. Your existing bookings, customers, and settings stay exactly as they are.</p>

    <h2 data-en="Managing Your Subscription" data-fr="Gérer votre abonnement">Managing Your Subscription</h2>
    <p data-en='After upgrading, you can manage your subscription at any time from <strong>Settings &gt; Billing &gt; Manage Subscription</strong>. This opens the Stripe Customer Portal where you can:' data-fr='Après la mise à niveau, vous pouvez gérer votre abonnement à tout moment depuis <strong>Paramètres &gt; Facturation &gt; Gérer l&apos;abonnement</strong>. Cela ouvre le portail client Stripe où vous pouvez :'>After upgrading, you can manage your subscription at any time from <strong>Settings &gt; Billing &gt; Manage Subscription</strong>. This opens the Stripe Customer Portal where you can:</p>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3 data-en="Update Your Payment Method" data-fr="Mettre à jour votre mode de paiement">Update Your Payment Method</h3>
      <p data-en="Changed your credit card? Update your payment details anytime from the customer portal. Your subscription continues without interruption." data-fr="Vous avez changé de carte de crédit ? Mettez à jour vos informations de paiement à tout moment depuis le portail client. Votre abonnement continue sans interruption.">Changed your credit card? Update your payment details anytime from the customer portal. Your subscription continues without interruption.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3 data-en="Switch Between Plans" data-fr="Changer de forfait">Switch Between Plans</h3>
      <p data-en='Need to upgrade to a higher plan or downgrade to a smaller one? You can switch plans from the customer portal. When you change plans, the difference is <strong>prorated</strong> — you only pay the difference for the remaining time on your current billing cycle.' data-fr='Besoin de passer à un forfait supérieur ou de réduire à un plus petit ? Vous pouvez changer de forfait depuis le portail client. Lorsque vous changez de forfait, la différence est <strong>calculée au prorata</strong> — vous ne payez que la différence pour le temps restant de votre cycle de facturation actuel.'>Need to upgrade to a higher plan or downgrade to a smaller one? You can switch plans from the customer portal. When you change plans, the difference is <strong>prorated</strong> — you only pay the difference for the remaining time on your current billing cycle.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3 data-en="View Your Invoices" data-fr="Consulter vos factures">View Your Invoices</h3>
      <p data-en="Access all your past invoices and receipts from the customer portal. Download them for your records or for tax purposes." data-fr="Accédez à toutes vos factures et reçus passés depuis le portail client. Téléchargez-les pour vos dossiers ou à des fins fiscales.">Access all your past invoices and receipts from the customer portal. Download them for your records or for tax purposes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3 data-en="Cancel Your Subscription" data-fr="Annuler votre abonnement">Cancel Your Subscription</h3>
      <p data-en="If you decide to cancel, you can do so from the customer portal. Your paid plan remains active until the end of your current billing period. After that, your account reverts to trial-level limits." data-fr="Si vous décidez d&apos;annuler, vous pouvez le faire depuis le portail client. Votre forfait payant reste actif jusqu&apos;à la fin de votre période de facturation en cours. Après cela, votre compte revient aux limites du niveau d&apos;essai.">If you decide to cancel, you can do so from the customer portal. Your paid plan remains active until the end of your current billing period. After that, your account reverts to trial-level limits.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 data-en="What Happens If You Cancel" data-fr="Ce qui se passe si vous annulez">What Happens If You Cancel</h2>
    <p data-en="If you cancel your subscription, your account is not deleted. Here is what happens:" data-fr="Si vous annulez votre abonnement, votre compte n&apos;est pas supprimé. Voici ce qui se passe :">If you cancel your subscription, your account is not deleted. Here is what happens:</p>
    <ul>
      <li data-en="Your paid plan stays active until the end of the billing period you already paid for" data-fr="Votre forfait payant reste actif jusqu&apos;à la fin de la période de facturation que vous avez déjà payée">Your paid plan stays active until the end of the billing period you already paid for</li>
      <li data-en="After that, your account is downgraded to trial-level limits (1 staff, 3 services, 10 bookings per month)" data-fr="Après cela, votre compte est rétrogradé aux limites du niveau d&apos;essai (1 membre du personnel, 3 services, 10 réservations par mois)">After that, your account is downgraded to trial-level limits (1 staff, 3 services, 10 bookings per month)</li>
      <li data-en='<strong>All your data is preserved</strong> — bookings, customers, settings, everything stays in your account' data-fr='<strong>Toutes vos données sont préservées</strong> — réservations, clients, paramètres, tout reste dans votre compte'><strong>All your data is preserved</strong> — bookings, customers, settings, everything stays in your account</li>
      <li data-en="You can resubscribe at any time to restore full access" data-fr="Vous pouvez vous réabonner à tout moment pour restaurer l&apos;accès complet">You can resubscribe at any time to restore full access</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="tip">
      <p data-en='<strong>Pro Tip:</strong> If you are unsure which plan is right for you, start with the plan that matches your current team size. You can always upgrade later as your business grows, and the prorated billing means you only pay the difference.' data-fr='<strong>Conseil pro :</strong> Si vous n&apos;êtes pas certain du forfait qui vous convient, commencez par celui qui correspond à la taille actuelle de votre équipe. Vous pouvez toujours mettre à niveau plus tard à mesure que votre entreprise grandit, et la facturation au prorata signifie que vous ne payez que la différence.'><strong>Pro Tip:</strong> If you are unsure which plan is right for you, start with the plan that matches your current team size. You can always upgrade later as your business grows, and the prorated billing means you only pay the difference.</p>
    </div>

    <blockquote data-en="Upgrading takes less than two minutes, and your new limits apply immediately. No setup, no waiting, no reconfiguration needed." data-fr="La mise à niveau prend moins de deux minutes et vos nouvelles limites s&apos;appliquent immédiatement. Aucune configuration, aucune attente, aucune reconfiguration nécessaire.">Upgrading takes less than two minutes, and your new limits apply immediately. No setup, no waiting, no reconfiguration needed.</blockquote>

    <p data-en='Still exploring? Start with our guide on <a href="/blog/how-to-sign-up">how to sign up for your free trial</a>, or learn about all the features available in your <a href="/blog/dashboard-guide">dashboard</a>.' data-fr='Encore en exploration ? Commencez par notre guide sur <a href="/blog/how-to-sign-up">comment s&apos;inscrire à votre essai gratuit</a>, ou découvrez toutes les fonctionnalités disponibles dans votre <a href="/blog/dashboard-guide">tableau de bord</a>.'>Still exploring? Start with our guide on <a href="/blog/how-to-sign-up">how to sign up for your free trial</a>, or learn about all the features available in your <a href="/blog/dashboard-guide">dashboard</a>.</p>

    <div class="blog-cta">
